A '''Vial of Venom''' is an {{Epic}} [[Permanent Consumable]] item used to increase the player's {{Stat|cd}}.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Vial of Venom''' has a {{Chance|0.5%|1|200}} chance to drop from a {{SlayerTier|4}} or above {{MobSprite|Tarantula Broodfather}} once at {{Coll|Spider Slayer VI}}.

== Usage ==
Consuming a '''Vial of Venom''' grants {{SBXP|+2}} and a permanent {{stat|crit damage|+1}}. Up to {{Green|5}} '''Vials of Venom''' can be consumed in total.

